 ## 5.3rc1
 
+### Deprecated
+
+- The `viewandmanageselect` context value of the `mod_forum/forum_subscription_action` template, exported by `\mod_forum\output\subscription_actionbar`, is deprecated. It is still exported as `core/url_select` data so that existing template overrides keep working, but the core template now uses the new `viewandmanageselectmenu` context value, which contains `core/select_menu` data rendered through the `core/tertiary_navigation_selector` template. Template overrides should be updated to use `viewandmanageselectmenu`.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89890](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89890)
+
 ### Added
 
 - Added the method `discussion::get_discussion_navigation_buttons()` that returns data for the discussion navigation template.
